{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_219_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，王正月，癸亥，鄭游速帥師滅許，以許男斯歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"二、二月，公侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"三、公至自侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"四、夏，季孫斯、仲孫何忌如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉人執宋行人樂祁犁。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"六、冬，城中城。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"城中城者，三家張也。或曰，非外民也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_219_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_219","textTraditional":"七、季孫斯、仲孫忌帥師圍鄆。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}